&lt;h2&gt;


&lt;strong&gt;When Should You Choose ReactJS?&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ReactJS is a great choice when you need to build dynamic and interactive web applications. If your website requires real-time updates or complex user interfaces, ReactJS can handle it efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It is also ideal for businesses planning to scale in the future. ReactJS makes it easy to add new features and expand functionality without rebuilding the entire system.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Startups and growing businesses can benefit greatly from ReactJS because it allows faster development and quicker time to market.&lt;/p&gt;

