&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/facebook/metro/releases/tag/v0.84.3" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Metro 0.84.3 - TLS support, Fast Refresh heartbeat, optimized cache&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
